## Stage 3: Intermediate Querying & Logic
Writing modular, maintainable, and conditional queries for complex reporting.
Subqueries & Nested Queries:
   Scalar subqueries, multi-row subqueries, correlated subqueries
   EXISTS, NOT EXISTS, IN, ANY, ALL
Common Table Expressions (CTEs):
   WITH clause for temporary result sets
   Recursive CTEs** for hierarchical data (e.g., organizational charts, parent-child trees)
Conditional Statements:** CASE WHEN ... THEN ... ELSE END
Built-in Functions:** String operations (CONCAT, SUBSTRING), Date handling (DATEDIFF, DATEADD), and Type Casting (CAST, CONVERT)
